---
---

<section id="pricing" class="border-t border-(--color-line) bg-panel py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <h2 class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-paper md:text-4xl">Pricing</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-(--color-paper-dim)">
      One self-hosted image, two ways to run it. Nothing that makes the product work is ever behind a license.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="card p-8" data-reveal="pricing">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-paper">Free</h3>
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-paper-dim)">$0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-(--color-paper-dim)">
          Everything that makes the product work. Unlimited events, unlimited retention, Postgres — your
          infrastructure, your data.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-8" data-reveal="pricing" style="border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-flame) 35%, var(--color-line))">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-paper">Licensed</h3>
          <a
            href="mailto:hello@promhis.io?subject=Promhis%20Licensed%20edition"
            class="text-lg font-semibold text-(--color-flame-bright) underline underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-paper"
          >
            Contact us
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-(--color-paper-dim)">
          Everything in Free, plus whichever licensed features your license unlocks — multiple admin users, more
          API tokens, custom branding, and more as they ship.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-(--color-paper-dim)">
      No usage metering, no self-serve checkout — getting a license today is a quick conversation with us, not a
      subscription form.
      <a href="https://github.com/tom-jm69/promhis/blob/main/PRICING.md" class="text-(--color-flame-bright) underline underline-offset-4">Full feature breakdown →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
